ated inline completions code\n* #1428: add exp filter for fcv1 copilot token flag\n* #1426: nes: include config value\n* #1370: Removes unneeded translation, as id is removed now from core\n* #1424: more alignment on agent terminology\n* #1423: Remove old gpt-5-codex prompt\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=366143&view=logs).</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/releases/255941211/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}}